      <h1 class="Title"><a name="11"></a>Title 11<br />GENERAL PLANS AND SUBDIVISIONS</h1>
            <p class="P0">This Title provides procedures and standards for the adoption, amendment and readoption of the City&rsquo;s General Plan in accordance with A.R.S. &sect; <a href="/cgi-bin/ars.pl?cite=9-461.01" target="_parent">9-461.01</a> et. seq., as well as procedures and standards for the subdivision of land in accordance with A.R.S. &sect; <a href="/cgi-bin/ars.pl?cite=9-463" target="_parent">9-463</a> et. seq.</p>

